; minted 2026-08-08 (steward ratification, [[DECISIONS#d11-universal-path|D11 universal-path]] session: "yes unless there is something better")
|term[origin]
  :status settled
  :subject-field addressing
  :layer framing-vocabulary
  :gloss The location a path routes from — exactly one per path; its manner is one of explicit | implicit | universal.
  :dual-of @destination
  |designation origin
    :status preferred
    :channel prose
  |definition
    :defined-by @def-locations-and-paths
    :anchor path
    :projection paraphrase
    The origin location of a path — usually "wherever you are" (implicit), sometimes explicit shorthand, sometimes universal (routable from anywhere; see universal-path).
  |rel :kind part-of :to @path :card 1
  |rel :kind filled-by :to @location :card 1
  |invariant
    The manner is exactly one of explicit | implicit | universal (the origin trichotomy — steward sharpening 2026-08-08; def-locations-and-paths WN); a path whose origin manner is universal IS a universal path.
